The verbatim full-solution 'dotnet test apps/windows/TeslaSync.sln -c Release' (no filter) also runs the
TeslaSync.App.UITests suite (Category=UIAutomation, 147 tests), which drives the PACKAGED app out-of-process
over the W3C WebDriver protocol via WinAppDriver/Appium. This runner has no WinAppDriver/Appium listener and
no deployed MSIX, so the suite fails fast BY DESIGN (its csproj states it is never silently skipped). Probe
evidence (identical for all 147 failures):
