These are repo-wide app-shell E2E tests, NOT part of this surface — PageSkeleton adds ZERO UIAutomation tests.
Per the UITests csproj the headless and UIAutomation suites are run independently (run-ui-automation.ps1); the
headless result above is the surface gate. The 147 UIAutomation failures are an environment/runner-infra gap,
recorded here WITH evidence, NOT reported as green — the same convention as the shipped
p2-windows-shared-surfaces-0003-VisuallyHidden and p2-windows-feature-views-0228-FSMHealthPanel logs.

