--- Web source -> native parity (web/src/components/feedback/PageSkeleton.tsx) ---
The web source is a family of four shaped, presentational loading building blocks (no network data, no titles).
Native shared-surfaces/PageSkeleton.* reproduces all four with exact Tailwind-derived geometry:
  PageHeaderSkeleton -> title (h-8 w-64 -> 32x256) over subtitle (h-4 w-96 -> 16x384), space-y-2 (8) gap.
  StatGridSkeleton   -> 4-col grid (md+) of h-24 rounded-xl (96, r12) cards, gap-4 (16); wraps when cards>4.
  ChartBlockSkeleton -> single full-width rounded-xl (r12) box at height=320 (configurable).
  TableSkeleton      -> h-10 rounded-t-xl (40, r12) header over rows x cols of h-8 rounded (32, r6) cells,
                        space-y-2 (8) row gap, gap-3 (12) column gap; defaults rows=8 cols=4.

--- Acceptance criteria ---
[x] All web-source branches render: 4 blocks x configurable params (cards/height/rows/cols) x full/reduced motion.
    Web reads no network data -> no loading/error/stale/offline chrome; the skeleton IS the loading state
    (same precedent as the shipped Spinner surface). No hidden surfaces.
[x] Binds via the shared P1/S8 state-holder (PageSkeletonViewModel over IMotionPreferenceSource); view does no I/O.
[x] i18n: 4 keys registered in the P1/S10 catalog (Strings/en/Resources.resw):
